WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:15.230 --> 00:16.340
I was wrong to suspect you.

3
00:17.030 --> 00:17.940
You don't have to do this

4
00:17.960 --> 00:18.690
to make it up to me.

5
00:19.160 --> 00:20.580
I only want to know one thing.

6
00:21.760 --> 00:22.860
Do you have feelings for your cousin?

7
00:26.630 --> 00:27.900
Does your silence mean yes?

8
00:28.440 --> 00:29.100
That question

9
00:29.120 --> 00:30.010
doesn't warrant an answer.

10
00:30.400 --> 00:31.560
But since you came back,

11
00:31.670 --> 00:33.330
the only time I've seen you show any emotion

12
00:33.330 --> 00:34.610
was when she fainted.

13
00:34.710 --> 00:35.780
You're so concerned about her,

14
00:36.480 --> 00:37.780
yet you treat me like a stranger.

15
00:38.110 --> 00:39.820
It's not her I'm concerned about.

16
00:39.960 --> 00:41.370
You're still lying.

17
00:42.630 --> 00:44.690
Do you know how much gossip your trips into the mountains

18
00:44.800 --> 00:46.180
have caused

19
00:46.180 --> 00:47.070
in the village?

20
00:48.240 --> 00:49.090
They all say

21
00:49.520 --> 00:50.250
you've been keeping

22
00:50.250 --> 00:51.330
a mistress in secret.

23
00:51.670 --> 00:52.850
She's the one,

24
00:52.850 --> 00:53.580
isn't she?

25
00:55.560 --> 00:56.370
If you won't admit it,

26
00:57.200 --> 00:58.220
I'll ask her myself.

27
01:21.740 --> 01:27.620
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

28
01:29.660 --> 01:35.620
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

29
01:36.660 --> 01:40.900
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

30
01:44.580 --> 01:52.140
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

31
01:52.500 --> 01:59.260
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

32
02:00.500 --> 02:07.140
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

33
02:08.340 --> 02:15.180
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

34
02:16.780 --> 02:23.300
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

35
02:28.060 --> 02:29.860
[Blossom in Darkness]

36
02:29.860 --> 02:31.860
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

37
02:31.860 --> 02:34.860
[Episode 7]

38
02:42.520 --> 02:43.250
Xiangyuan.

39
02:44.430 --> 02:45.970
What a coincidence. I was just going to see you.

40
02:49.830 --> 02:50.460
What is it?

41
02:53.390 --> 02:54.180
I...

42
02:57.520 --> 02:59.060
I want to thank you

43
02:59.320 --> 03:00.810
for saving my unborn baby.

44
03:04.320 --> 03:05.530
I'm pregnant,

45
03:05.760 --> 03:06.640
three months along now,

46
03:07.110 --> 03:09.480
and I often feel weak.

47
03:09.830 --> 03:11.460
Thank you for the well water.

48
03:13.390 --> 03:15.250
My husband and I came to pay a visit,

49
03:15.550 --> 03:16.190
but we never imagined

50
03:16.190 --> 03:17.690
we'd cause you so much trouble.

51
03:19.550 --> 03:22.460
We... We're so sorry.

52
03:26.320 --> 03:27.340
Congratulations.

53
03:27.960 --> 03:30.160
Pregnancy has made me moody

54
03:30.270 --> 03:31.130
and suspicious.

55
03:31.430 --> 03:32.570
I hope I didn't frighten you.

56
03:32.670 --> 03:33.300
Of course not.

57
03:33.550 --> 03:34.900
How far along

58
03:34.920 --> 03:35.740
are you, Xiangyuan?

59
03:36.480 --> 03:36.850
I...

60
03:44.040 --> 03:44.900
How far along?

61
03:47.800 --> 03:48.850
How could I have forgotten

62
03:48.870 --> 03:49.740
how far along I am?

63
03:56.080 --> 03:56.650
Then

64
03:57.360 --> 03:59.220
when did my cousin last leave?

65
03:59.670 --> 04:00.530
Have you forgotten that too?

66
04:06.040 --> 04:07.620
With you pregnant,

67
04:08.270 --> 04:09.930
what was so urgent

68
04:10.390 --> 04:11.500
that he had to leave?

69
04:11.800 --> 04:13.210
Why do you keep asking me

70
04:13.210 --> 04:14.220
these questions?

71
04:15.240 --> 04:16.780
I've already told you I can't remember.

72
04:16.910 --> 04:17.540
That's all right.

73
04:18.390 --> 04:19.370
You don't have to remember

74
04:19.390 --> 04:20.100
the exact date.

75
04:21.080 --> 04:22.570
But you must remember roughly when.

76
04:23.390 --> 04:24.100
Why exactly

77
04:24.270 --> 04:25.740
did my cousin leave?

78
04:26.390 --> 04:27.860
And how did all that village gossip

79
04:28.230 --> 04:29.450
start?

80
04:30.710 --> 04:31.250
I'll do it.

81
04:31.640 --> 04:32.980
My head hurts so much.

82
04:33.320 --> 04:34.060
Don't worry.

83
04:34.390 --> 04:34.980
I'm dizzy.

84
04:35.150 --> 04:35.740
Xiangyuan.

85
04:36.200 --> 04:37.130
Take your time.

86
04:37.200 --> 04:38.010
Try to remember.

87
04:39.200 --> 04:39.770
Because...

88
04:40.000 --> 04:40.770
Why do you always

89
04:40.790 --> 04:41.660
use that excuse?

90
04:41.680 --> 04:42.540
Everyone in the village says...

91
04:47.390 --> 04:47.890
Honey,

92
04:48.000 --> 04:48.540
I'm home.

93
04:58.120 --> 04:58.890
It's been rainy,

94
04:59.830 --> 05:00.810
and the mountain paths are muddy.

95
05:02.320 --> 05:03.450
That's why I came home late.

96
05:06.080 --> 05:07.300
If the weather was so bad,

97
05:07.630 --> 05:08.980
why did you go into the mountains for herbs?

98
05:09.560 --> 05:10.700
You were gone for days.

99
05:17.190 --> 05:17.810
To bring you

100
05:17.830 --> 05:18.580
something nourishing, of course.

101
05:20.040 --> 05:20.610
All right.

102
05:21.040 --> 05:21.730
I was wrong.

103
05:22.430 --> 05:23.610
Please don't be angry.

104
05:24.390 --> 05:25.170
To make it up to you,

105
05:25.830 --> 05:26.810
whatever you ask,

106
05:27.120 --> 05:27.810
I'll do it.

107
05:28.360 --> 05:28.980
How's that?

108
05:33.270 --> 05:34.370
Then I want a baby.

109
05:37.160 --> 05:39.540
We'll have children someday.

110
05:40.120 --> 05:40.930
Didn't you say I could

111
05:40.950 --> 05:41.580
ask for anything?

112
05:41.630 --> 05:42.490
Why not this?

113
05:44.830 --> 05:46.060
I'm worried about your health.

114
05:46.070 --> 05:46.950
Why do you always

115
05:46.950 --> 05:47.980
brush me off with that excuse?

116
05:48.000 --> 05:49.450
There's nothing wrong with me.

117
05:50.360 --> 05:51.410
Cheng Kong, I don't understand.

118
05:52.000 --> 05:53.020
Why have you never

119
05:53.040 --> 05:54.250
slept with me since we married?

120
05:54.480 --> 05:55.340
Everyone says...

121
05:58.360 --> 05:59.080
They say you have

122
05:59.080 --> 06:00.370
another woman out there.

123
06:03.920 --> 06:05.370
Because I wanted a child,

124
06:07.070 --> 06:08.540
but Cheng Kong didn't.

125
06:10.950 --> 06:11.700
Xiangyuan,

126
06:12.830 --> 06:13.520
aren't you

127
06:13.520 --> 06:14.490
already pregnant?

128
06:15.360 --> 06:15.930
Yes.

129
06:17.120 --> 06:18.170
I'm pregnant.

130
06:20.160 --> 06:21.660
It was because I was pregnant

131
06:22.510 --> 06:23.580
that the rabbit demon...

132
06:24.120 --> 06:24.900
Rabbit demon?

133
06:27.680 --> 06:28.700
I didn't want

134
06:28.720 --> 06:29.810
to remember any of this.

135
06:30.950 --> 06:31.900
Why did you have to

136
06:31.920 --> 06:32.780
make me remember?

137
06:33.160 --> 06:33.700
Xiangyuan,

138
06:33.920 --> 06:34.580
calm down.

139
06:34.600 --> 06:35.020
I told you

140
06:35.040 --> 06:36.290
I didn't want to remember.

141
06:36.310 --> 06:37.220
Stop pushing me!

142
06:37.390 --> 06:37.850
Xiangyuan!

143
06:43.480 --> 06:45.140
The rabbit demon really is connected to Cheng Kong.

144
06:51.560 --> 06:52.220
Xiangyuan!

145
06:52.830 --> 06:53.850
Xiangyuan!

146
06:56.070 --> 06:56.780
Xiangyuan!

147
06:57.310 --> 06:57.980
Xiangyuan!

148
07:05.510 --> 07:06.020
Xiangyuan?

149
07:06.480 --> 07:06.980
Xiangyuan!

150
07:08.430 --> 07:08.850
Come on.

151
07:09.240 --> 07:09.930
Take her back.

152
07:44.560 --> 07:45.490
Such a strong demonic aura.

153
07:46.950 --> 07:47.730
It's the rabbit demon.

154
07:48.510 --> 07:49.850
We've searched everywhere

155
07:50.120 --> 07:50.850
and couldn't find it.

156
07:51.360 --> 07:52.900
Now it's come to us on its own.

157
07:59.040 --> 08:00.250
Don't be afraid, Hao.

158
08:00.480 --> 08:01.220
Stay behind me.

159
08:58.720 --> 08:59.730
Hao!

160
09:08.870 --> 09:09.460
Take her away.

161
09:55.320 --> 09:55.940
Master!

162
10:00.510 --> 10:01.490
Give me back the soul crystal!

163
10:30.990 --> 10:31.730
Master!

164
10:32.850 --> 10:34.520
I must regain my powers as soon as possible.

165
10:40.160 --> 10:41.220
You know how much

166
10:41.240 --> 10:42.250
that soul crystal means to me.

167
10:42.440 --> 10:43.760
If you'd taken proper care of it,

168
10:43.790 --> 10:45.100
it wouldn't have been taken away so easily.

169
10:47.390 --> 10:48.570
Still, you shouldn't have

170
10:48.570 --> 10:49.420
put yourself in danger

171
10:50.150 --> 10:51.460
and put my flower at risk.

172
10:53.630 --> 10:55.180
I've put up with you long enough!

173
11:00.870 --> 11:01.840
Your powers are back?

174
11:02.270 --> 11:03.460
I have enough to deal with you.

175
11:10.000 --> 11:10.610
Qi Fengyin,

176
11:11.000 --> 11:12.060
you have something

177
11:12.080 --> 11:12.850
you care deeply about too.

178
11:13.270 --> 11:14.580
Your mystical flower means so much to you.

179
11:14.790 --> 11:16.060
So put yourself in my shoes.

180
11:16.750 --> 11:17.700
You should know how it feels

181
11:18.120 --> 11:19.100
to lose something precious.

182
11:19.510 --> 11:20.490
I've already told you.

183
11:21.390 --> 11:22.490
After a few days' rest,

184
11:22.750 --> 11:24.490
I can overpower the Wanjun Lock again.

185
11:24.870 --> 11:26.530
I'll deal with the rabbit demon myself then.

186
11:27.000 --> 11:27.890
As for you,

187
11:29.600 --> 11:30.700
stop trying to be clever.

188
11:30.870 --> 11:31.770
If your powers

189
11:31.790 --> 11:33.180
could solve everything,

190
11:34.030 --> 11:34.890
why couldn't you reclaim

191
11:34.910 --> 11:36.250
your malice from Su Hexiang?

192
11:39.390 --> 11:40.420
Since your malice

193
11:40.750 --> 11:41.850
gets entwined with obsession,

194
11:42.360 --> 11:43.490
whether you like it or not,

195
11:44.120 --> 11:45.130
you'll have to take

196
11:45.840 --> 11:46.650
a good look at this world

197
11:46.720 --> 11:47.530
for yourself.

198
11:50.360 --> 11:51.580
I'll find the rabbit demon

199
11:52.000 --> 11:52.850
and get the soul crystal back.

200
11:54.030 --> 11:55.060
If it goes into hiding,

201
11:55.720 --> 11:57.220
I'll turn this whole mountain upside down.

202
11:58.080 --> 11:59.490
If it's swallowed the crystal,

203
11:59.910 --> 12:01.100
I'll cut its belly open.

204
12:02.270 --> 12:03.420
As long as there's the slightest hope,

205
12:04.360 --> 12:05.650
I won't give up on saving my master.

206
12:13.080 --> 12:14.490
The rabbit demon only appears at night.

207
12:15.030 --> 12:16.370
The mountain fog at night

208
12:16.630 --> 12:17.610
makes people fall asleep.

209
12:18.240 --> 12:19.490
If we want to capture the rabbit demon,

210
12:20.390 --> 12:22.250
we must first find a way to resist its effects.

211
12:38.390 --> 12:39.460
I could hear all that noise

212
12:39.480 --> 12:40.340
from a long way off.

213
12:40.600 --> 12:41.340
What's going on?

214
12:42.390 --> 12:43.460
Nothing, Xiangyuan.

215
12:43.840 --> 12:45.530
About our little misunderstanding yesterday...

216
12:46.000 --> 12:47.580
Let's not bring up yesterday.

217
12:48.390 --> 12:50.820
Pregnancy makes me so moody.

218
12:51.790 --> 12:52.650
I hope I didn't frighten you.

219
12:53.240 --> 12:53.850
Not at all.

220
12:54.240 --> 12:55.220
I'm just glad you're all right.

221
12:55.480 --> 12:57.100
I need to take care of something,

222
12:57.360 --> 12:58.460
so I'll skip breakfast.

223
13:06.270 --> 13:06.890
Yamao.

224
13:11.910 --> 13:12.580
Are you

225
13:13.390 --> 13:14.940
worried about High Immortal Danshen?

226
13:53.080 --> 13:53.890
Don't worry.

227
13:54.790 --> 13:56.180
High Immortal Danshen keeps all evil at bay.

228
13:56.670 --> 13:58.370
No ordinary demon would dare harm him.

229
13:59.120 --> 13:59.850
We'll find the crystal

230
13:59.870 --> 14:00.530
in no time.

231
14:02.240 --> 14:03.370
Thank you, Hao.

232
14:04.790 --> 14:05.250
But

233
14:05.790 --> 14:06.700
I wasn't crying.

234
14:23.150 --> 14:24.250
There's no point

235
14:24.360 --> 14:25.010
in being upset now.

236
14:25.480 --> 14:26.130
I know that.

237
14:26.960 --> 14:27.820
The priority

238
14:27.870 --> 14:29.250
is to gather all these herbs.

239
14:29.550 --> 14:30.340
It's quite a long list.

240
14:33.270 --> 14:34.340
Can these herbs help us

241
14:35.120 --> 14:36.060
fight the rabbit demon?

242
14:36.790 --> 14:37.770
They can't,

243
14:38.320 --> 14:39.700
but they can protect us from the fog at night.

244
14:42.960 --> 14:44.300
So it's not demonic power that's been

245
14:44.870 --> 14:46.130
making us pass out at night.

246
14:47.150 --> 14:48.130
How did you find that out?

247
14:48.960 --> 14:49.980
Never mind that.

248
14:50.870 --> 14:52.180
Once we've gathered these herbs,

249
14:52.390 --> 14:53.220
I'll make a remedy from them.

250
14:53.480 --> 14:54.490
It'll help us

251
14:54.550 --> 14:55.250
hold our breath

252
14:55.360 --> 14:56.460
so the fog at night won't affect us.

253
14:57.120 --> 14:57.980
Then we can find out

254
14:58.030 --> 14:59.100
what's really happening in the village.

255
15:23.790 --> 15:24.530
Hao.

256
15:29.960 --> 15:31.340
I've gathered all the herbs,

257
15:32.120 --> 15:33.340
except the fruit at the top of this tree.

258
15:36.360 --> 15:36.940
I'll do it.

259
15:38.150 --> 15:38.700
You?

260
15:40.200 --> 15:40.790
Have you forgotten

261
15:40.790 --> 15:42.060
I grew up in Luoshen Valley?

262
15:42.870 --> 15:43.940
This is easy for me.

263
16:04.750 --> 16:05.460
What's so funny?

264
16:09.600 --> 16:11.820
You're so agile, Yamao.

265
16:12.360 --> 16:14.370
From a distance, you look a bit like...

266
16:16.360 --> 16:17.060
a wild monkey.

267
16:17.720 --> 16:18.020
You...

268
16:25.730 --> 16:26.180
Catch.

269
16:45.670 --> 16:47.010
This fruit's really sweet. Try it.

270
16:57.200 --> 16:58.250
Bitter, isn't it?

271
16:58.910 --> 17:00.220
Consider it

272
17:00.220 --> 17:01.250
a little punishment.

273
17:01.440 --> 17:02.510
Maybe you'll think twice next time.

274
17:03.030 --> 17:04.220
I didn't mean to offend you.

275
17:05.110 --> 17:06.380
That was

276
17:07.200 --> 17:08.290
for your little scheme

277
17:08.310 --> 17:09.730
to steal your spiritual mark back.

278
17:12.400 --> 17:14.220
Luckily, your conscience kicked in, and you stopped

279
17:14.240 --> 17:14.730
in time.

280
17:16.830 --> 17:17.420
Rinse your mouth.

281
17:22.400 --> 17:23.900
Don't worry. It's not poisoned.

282
17:36.160 --> 17:37.330
You're still in the mood to tease me?

283
17:41.590 --> 17:43.180
It beats driving myself crazy with worry.

284
17:46.000 --> 17:46.860
That little doll demon

285
17:47.350 --> 17:48.330
is hiding something from you.

286
17:49.200 --> 17:50.660
If you keep letting Qi Fengyin

287
17:50.880 --> 17:51.860
water the mystical flower,

288
17:52.270 --> 17:53.140
you won't be able to withstand

289
17:53.160 --> 17:53.980
the damage done by his malice,

290
17:54.480 --> 17:55.770
and you'll end up dead.

291
18:00.480 --> 18:01.140
I know.

292
18:02.550 --> 18:03.770
But the well water

293
18:03.790 --> 18:04.660
can keep me alive.

294
18:05.480 --> 18:06.010
Besides,

295
18:06.310 --> 18:06.980
for the sake of the flower,

296
18:07.310 --> 18:08.460
Qi Fengyin won't let me die.

297
18:08.790 --> 18:09.810
He kills on a whim.

298
18:10.440 --> 18:11.700
He unleashed a firestorm on Luoshen Valley

299
18:12.070 --> 18:13.290
and gravely wounded High Immortal Danshen.

300
18:14.030 --> 18:15.460
How can you trust him with your life?

301
18:15.830 --> 18:19.090
The barrier on Mount Qihuang was still intact then.

302
18:20.000 --> 18:21.860
Qi Fengyin was still sealed inside.

303
18:23.480 --> 18:24.730
Isn't it possible

304
18:25.400 --> 18:26.730
that the firestorm in Luoshen Valley

305
18:26.920 --> 18:27.700
wasn't his doing?

306
18:27.790 --> 18:28.380
Nonsense.

307
18:31.640 --> 18:33.050
Qi Fengyin's scattered malice

308
18:33.720 --> 18:35.420
is drawn to people consumed by obsession.

309
18:35.720 --> 18:36.700
Whether at Mount Leiguan

310
18:37.440 --> 18:38.420
or in this little village,

311
18:39.830 --> 18:41.140
wherever that malice goes,

312
18:41.750 --> 18:42.620
innocent people

313
18:42.720 --> 18:43.380
get caught up in it.

314
18:44.790 --> 18:46.140
You may not believe this,

315
18:47.160 --> 18:47.900
but my master

316
18:48.200 --> 18:49.530
used to be all I cared about.

317
18:50.200 --> 18:52.140
Since leaving Luoshen Valley

318
18:52.550 --> 18:53.700
and going through all this,

319
18:55.200 --> 18:56.220
I've realized

320
18:56.720 --> 18:58.330
that besides seeking Master's protection,

321
18:59.110 --> 19:00.250
I can protect the people

322
19:00.250 --> 19:01.220
I care about too.

323
19:04.160 --> 19:04.980
I may be weak,

324
19:07.310 --> 19:08.660
but I'm just like this fruit.

325
19:09.640 --> 19:11.860
With its vine winding around the tree trunk

326
19:12.110 --> 19:12.810
and climbing to the top,

327
19:13.110 --> 19:13.860
it eventually becomes

328
19:13.920 --> 19:14.810
a useful Sunward Fruit.

329
19:15.830 --> 19:16.660
A fruit,

330
19:17.000 --> 19:17.660
a flower,

331
19:18.200 --> 19:18.810
a vine...

332
19:19.960 --> 19:21.050
All things in this world

333
19:21.400 --> 19:22.900
draw on what's around them to survive

334
19:25.400 --> 19:26.730
and become something better.

335
19:29.680 --> 19:30.660
I should do the same.

336
19:39.400 --> 19:40.330
All right. Let's head back.

337
19:58.240 --> 19:59.220
Since your malice

338
19:59.790 --> 20:00.980
gets entwined with obsession,

339
20:01.240 --> 20:02.330
whether you like it or not,

340
20:03.110 --> 20:04.090
you'll have to take

341
20:04.880 --> 20:05.700
a good look at this world

342
20:05.720 --> 20:06.490
for yourself.

343
20:29.510 --> 20:30.250
Let me.

344
20:38.200 --> 20:41.050
I thought you'd ignore me after all the nonsense

345
20:41.400 --> 20:42.330
I said yesterday.

346
20:42.680 --> 20:44.010
Did I often lose my temper?

347
20:44.830 --> 20:46.010
You were always gentle

348
20:47.240 --> 20:48.660
and never really lost your temper.

349
20:49.440 --> 20:50.610
That's why, since you came back,

350
20:50.720 --> 20:52.050
you've seemed like a stranger to me.

351
20:52.350 --> 20:54.420
Sometimes I even wake with a start

352
20:54.480 --> 20:56.180
and feel as if this is all a dream.

353
20:56.480 --> 20:58.180
Then what was

354
20:59.070 --> 21:00.220
the Cheng Kong you knew like?

355
21:01.480 --> 21:02.930
You were patient with me

356
21:03.830 --> 21:05.220
and always took good care of me.

357
21:05.830 --> 21:07.010
We grew up together

358
21:07.240 --> 21:08.220
and fell in love.

359
21:08.880 --> 21:10.490
We came here to live in seclusion.

360
21:13.070 --> 21:14.530
But our happiness didn't last.

361
21:16.070 --> 21:18.220
You kept leaving me alone,

362
21:18.270 --> 21:19.460
going away for days at a time

363
21:20.030 --> 21:21.140
without ever telling me why.

364
21:21.510 --> 21:22.700
I didn't know where you went.

365
21:23.480 --> 21:24.730
I was so scared.

366
21:25.640 --> 21:26.770
Everyone in the village said

367
21:27.510 --> 21:28.900
you'd grown tired of me

368
21:29.160 --> 21:30.660
and were secretly keeping a mistress.

369
21:31.550 --> 21:32.730
The last time you left,

370
21:34.640 --> 21:36.180
I cried for so long.

371
21:37.920 --> 21:39.330
I thought you'd never come back.

372
21:41.270 --> 21:42.860
Who did you see last,

373
21:45.030 --> 21:45.940
me

374
21:47.720 --> 21:48.730
or Cheng Kong?

375
21:57.510 --> 21:58.490
You're not Cheng Kong.

376
21:59.160 --> 21:59.730
Who are you?

377
22:09.070 --> 22:10.700
Xiangyuan was so close

378
22:10.720 --> 22:12.240
to remembering everything.

379
22:12.830 --> 22:14.420
Once her memory returns,

380
22:14.830 --> 22:16.530
we can solve all these mysteries.

381
22:20.550 --> 22:21.940
When the rabbit demon appeared last night,

382
22:22.830 --> 22:24.940
it seemed intent on keeping us from learning the truth.

383
22:25.290 --> 22:26.770
It went straight for Xiangyuan.

384
22:29.430 --> 22:30.730
If not for Qi Fengyin,

385
22:31.160 --> 22:32.930
it would probably have killed her.

386
22:48.550 --> 22:49.330
This jade pendant

387
22:49.960 --> 22:51.010
looks so familiar.

388
22:51.310 --> 22:51.980
Let me see.

389
23:00.000 --> 23:01.570
The rabbit demon had one last night.

390
23:01.830 --> 23:02.460
Could it be

391
23:02.720 --> 23:04.050
that it ate Cheng Kong

392
23:04.270 --> 23:05.180
and stole his things?

393
23:05.440 --> 23:05.860
Then

394
23:06.640 --> 23:08.290
why is the rabbit demon so determined

395
23:08.290 --> 23:09.640
to hurt the two of them?

396
23:09.680 --> 23:11.180
Since it's after Xiangyuan,

397
23:11.270 --> 23:12.090
the rabbit demon

398
23:12.680 --> 23:13.730
will surely return tonight.

399
23:25.110 --> 23:25.770
Let's see where

400
23:25.830 --> 23:26.900
that rabbit can run tonight.

401
23:28.830 --> 23:29.250
It's here.

402
24:15.110 --> 24:15.620
Yamao,

403
24:16.070 --> 24:16.700
what's wrong?

404
24:38.200 --> 24:39.010
What's happened to Yamao?

405
24:39.350 --> 24:40.380
The demonic aura has affected her.

406
24:40.790 --> 24:41.900
She's become a mindless husk too.

407
24:42.790 --> 24:43.770
Why aren't we affected?

408
24:45.270 --> 24:46.090
Is there a way to turn her back?

409
24:46.090 --> 24:47.330
We may have to wait until dawn.

410
24:48.880 --> 24:49.860
I'll keep her under control.

411
24:50.240 --> 24:51.290
The rabbit demon's still nearby.

412
24:51.480 --> 24:52.050
Go after it.

413
24:52.480 --> 24:53.220
Make sure you bring back

414
24:53.240 --> 24:54.180
her master's soul crystal.

415
24:54.350 --> 24:54.980
I know

416
24:55.270 --> 24:56.140
what to do.

417
24:59.550 --> 25:00.050
Yamao.

418
25:01.160 --> 25:01.700
Yamao!

419
25:56.880 --> 25:59.290
- Kill it! - Kill it!

420
26:00.110 --> 26:01.050
Don't hurt him!

421
26:01.110 --> 26:02.180
- Kill it! - Kill it!

422
26:04.070 --> 26:15.490
- Kill it! - Kill it!

423
26:24.600 --> 26:25.350
What's going on?

424
26:25.350 --> 26:25.860
They...

425
26:46.910 --> 26:48.090
We were all wrong.

426
26:48.220 --> 26:49.330
The demonic power affecting the villagers

427
26:50.160 --> 26:51.240
isn't from the rabbit demon.

428
26:52.550 --> 26:53.800
You're yourself again?

429
27:04.030 --> 27:05.250
Even if I knock her out again,

430
27:05.680 --> 27:06.700
she'll wake up soon.

431
27:07.510 --> 27:09.010
I can't keep doing this.

432
28:22.310 --> 28:23.010
Did you find it?

433
28:25.440 --> 28:26.220
I lost track of it

434
28:26.750 --> 28:27.860
deep in the mountains.

435
28:31.920 --> 28:32.460
Your wound...

436
28:32.640 --> 28:33.290
It's nothing.

437
28:35.400 --> 28:36.140
Where's Yamao?

438
28:41.350 --> 28:42.620
My head hurts.

439
28:43.720 --> 28:44.530
What happened?

440
28:44.720 --> 28:45.920
Weren't we after the rabbit demon?

441
28:45.920 --> 28:47.180
While we were hunting it last night,

442
28:47.720 --> 28:48.860
you suddenly lost control

443
28:49.350 --> 28:50.220
and became mindless.

444
28:51.790 --> 28:52.290
What?

445
28:55.590 --> 28:56.900
Why can't I remember any of it?

446
28:58.960 --> 29:00.090
Did you get the soul crystal back?

447
29:00.270 --> 29:00.980
Ask him yourself.

448
29:03.000 --> 29:03.700
I lost track of it.

449
29:06.070 --> 29:07.530
When you turned mindless last night,

450
29:07.750 --> 29:08.730
you said something.

451
29:10.070 --> 29:11.010
You said the demonic power

452
29:11.310 --> 29:12.620
affecting this village

453
29:13.110 --> 29:14.330
wasn't from the rabbit demon.

454
29:16.480 --> 29:17.660
Did you see something?

455
29:23.720 --> 29:24.290
I...

456
29:25.880 --> 29:26.490
I really can't

457
29:26.510 --> 29:27.490
remember anything.

458
29:28.200 --> 29:28.620
I...

459
29:29.510 --> 29:30.770
All I know is...

460
29:35.510 --> 29:36.420
my teeth hurt.

461
29:38.240 --> 29:39.770
You spent all night biting everything in sight.

462
29:39.920 --> 29:40.900
Of course your teeth hurt.

463
29:44.640 --> 29:44.980
You...

464
29:45.640 --> 29:46.330
That wound...

465
29:46.920 --> 29:47.790
It has nothing to do with you.

466
29:56.830 --> 29:57.890
Why was I

467
29:58.080 --> 29:59.500
the only one who turned into a mindless husk?

468
30:08.310 --> 30:09.570
When we were hunting the rabbit demon,

469
30:10.070 --> 30:11.290
I was the only one who attacked it.

470
30:12.440 --> 30:13.250
Could it be

471
30:13.720 --> 30:15.050
only those who've attacked the rabbit demon

472
30:15.680 --> 30:16.730
turn into mindless husks?

473
30:34.270 --> 30:35.660
Did you catch the rabbit demon?

474
30:39.030 --> 30:39.940
Don't blame me for this.

475
30:40.160 --> 30:41.810
You left me alone to watch her.

476
30:42.000 --> 30:43.810
She turns into a mindless husk at night.

477
30:44.110 --> 30:45.900
I had to tie her up so she wouldn't bite me.

478
30:46.240 --> 30:47.570
Did she act any differently last night?

479
30:49.400 --> 30:50.220
Same as usual.

480
30:50.550 --> 30:51.360
She slept for a while,

481
30:51.360 --> 30:52.180
then thrashed around all night.

482
30:52.550 --> 30:53.810
At dawn, she fell asleep again.

483
31:23.030 --> 31:24.290
What's with that look?

484
31:25.000 --> 31:25.660
Is she dying?

485
31:25.790 --> 31:26.620
Xiangyuan's fine.

486
31:27.790 --> 31:28.490
But

487
31:29.310 --> 31:30.250
she's not pregnant.

488
31:30.400 --> 31:30.940
What?

489
31:32.160 --> 31:33.420
Then why does she keep saying

490
31:33.550 --> 31:34.180
she's pregnant?

491
31:34.270 --> 31:35.540
Xiangyuan can't even tell

492
31:35.540 --> 31:36.530
who her own husband is.

493
31:37.270 --> 31:38.730
It's no surprise she doesn't know

494
31:39.030 --> 31:39.900
whether she's pregnant.

495
31:40.550 --> 31:42.090
What I can't understand

496
31:42.550 --> 31:43.420
is why the rabbit demon

497
31:43.440 --> 31:44.900
is so determined to hurt them both.

498
31:46.030 --> 31:46.860
At this point,

499
31:47.680 --> 31:49.180
I'll have to wait until I turn mindless tonight

500
31:49.400 --> 31:50.700
to keep investigating.

501
31:50.750 --> 31:52.180
You turned mindless?

502
31:52.680 --> 31:53.770
What happened last night?

503
31:53.830 --> 31:55.180
It's a long story.

504
31:56.200 --> 31:56.810
Anyway,

505
31:56.880 --> 31:57.900
I already have a plan.

506
32:05.270 --> 32:05.980
Hao...

507
32:13.030 --> 32:13.380
Stand right here.

508
32:14.550 --> 32:15.420
Tell me the truth.

509
32:15.960 --> 32:17.050
Are you planning to give Yuwen Hao

510
32:17.110 --> 32:17.810
his spiritual mark back?

511
32:17.960 --> 32:19.090
Desperate times, desperate measures.

512
32:19.750 --> 32:21.150
When I turn mindless tonight,

513
32:21.440 --> 32:22.340
I'll only be a burden.

514
32:22.420 --> 32:23.910
Qi Fengyin already has his hands full

515
32:23.910 --> 32:24.770
dealing with me.

516
32:24.880 --> 32:25.900
To keep everyone safe,

517
32:26.160 --> 32:27.620
hold off the mindless husks, and buy time,

518
32:28.110 --> 32:29.260
we'll have to rely on Hao.

519
32:29.350 --> 32:30.140
Are you out of your mind?

520
32:30.550 --> 32:31.960
Just think for a moment.

521
32:32.270 --> 32:33.010
Why did he follow you

522
32:33.010 --> 32:33.940
all the way here?

523
32:34.440 --> 32:36.220
Once Yuwen Hao gets his powers back,

524
32:36.400 --> 32:37.770
do you think you'll survive?

525
32:38.550 --> 32:39.420
I'm afraid it won't be

526
32:39.640 --> 32:41.090
the mindless husks that kill you.

527
32:41.240 --> 32:41.900
It'll be

528
32:41.920 --> 32:42.980
his sword.

529
32:44.400 --> 32:44.940
I'll take that chance.

530
32:45.510 --> 32:47.530
Take that chance? You'll stake your life

531
32:47.720 --> 32:48.730
on that sect lackey's conscience?

532
32:49.070 --> 32:50.010
Don't be ridiculous.

533
33:04.920 --> 33:05.810
Hao still

534
33:05.880 --> 33:06.860
has a soft spot for me.

535
33:07.920 --> 33:09.140
He was the one who helped me

536
33:09.880 --> 33:11.420
avoid the traps outside the village.

537
33:12.550 --> 33:13.330
Right now,

538
33:13.880 --> 33:15.460
I have no choice

539
33:15.830 --> 33:16.700
but to trust him.

540
33:17.960 --> 33:18.570
At the very least,

541
33:19.960 --> 33:21.420
he'll help me save Master.

542
33:23.640 --> 33:25.050
I'll return his spiritual mark first.

543
33:38.680 --> 33:39.140
You...

544
33:39.640 --> 33:40.810
Which sect are you from?

545
33:41.200 --> 33:41.980
Why haven't I seen you before?

546
33:42.160 --> 33:43.570
We come from a minor sect.

547
33:44.110 --> 33:45.290
Once we've cut out your herb core

548
33:45.350 --> 33:46.250
and taken it to Mount Zhaowu,

549
33:46.440 --> 33:47.940
we'll be famous throughout the world.

550
34:10.590 --> 34:11.130
Hao,

551
34:11.320 --> 34:12.340
I... I was going

552
34:12.630 --> 34:13.650
to give it back to you anyway.

553
34:23.800 --> 34:24.530
Master Yuwen?

554
34:27.960 --> 34:28.690
May I ask

555
34:29.440 --> 34:30.530
which sect you two belong to

556
34:31.360 --> 34:32.530
and what brings you here?

557
34:32.550 --> 34:33.380
You may not have heard, sir.

558
34:34.000 --> 34:35.940
Mount Zhaowu has sent word to all the immortal sects.

559
34:36.110 --> 34:37.090
Disciples from every sect

560
34:37.400 --> 34:38.460
are hunting this herb spirit

561
34:39.000 --> 34:39.980
to retrieve her herb core

562
34:40.360 --> 34:41.340
and revive the Saintess of the Tides.

563
34:42.000 --> 34:42.650
How fortunate

564
34:42.670 --> 34:43.530
to meet you here, Master Yuwen.

565
34:44.070 --> 34:46.170
Now this herb spirit has nowhere to run.

566
34:52.770 --> 34:53.750
You liar.

567
34:53.750 --> 34:54.740
I never should've trusted you!

568
35:05.030 --> 35:05.740
Master Yuwen,

569
35:06.440 --> 35:07.460
what are you doing?

570
35:07.710 --> 35:08.380
As long as I hold this sword,

571
35:10.000 --> 35:11.420
no one will lay a finger on her.

572
35:13.320 --> 35:14.740
You're Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple.

573
35:15.190 --> 35:16.260
How can you protect her in defiance

574
35:16.280 --> 35:17.130
of your sect's orders?

575
35:17.360 --> 35:18.860
What about the future of the world?

576
35:19.440 --> 35:20.610
I'll keep her safe.

577
35:22.000 --> 35:22.650
And I'll keep

578
35:23.710 --> 35:24.490
the world safe too.

579
35:28.280 --> 35:29.780
You can't have it both ways.

580
35:30.400 --> 35:31.260
By doing this,

581
35:31.710 --> 35:33.010
you're betraying not only Mount Zhaowu

582
35:33.320 --> 35:34.340
but also all the other immortal sects!

583
35:35.840 --> 35:36.650
My mind is made up.

584
35:40.880 --> 35:41.260
Fine.

585
35:41.960 --> 35:43.130
We'll tell all the immortal sects

586
35:43.360 --> 35:44.300
what you've done.

587
35:44.800 --> 35:45.300
Yuwen Hao,

588
35:46.000 --> 35:46.380
you...

589
35:46.760 --> 35:47.570
you'd better watch yourself!

590
35:48.190 --> 35:48.820
Let's go.

591
35:53.960 --> 35:54.900
Thank you, Hao.

592
35:58.110 --> 35:58.860
So I'm not a liar anymore?

593
35:59.110 --> 36:00.050
I was just panicking.

594
36:02.280 --> 36:03.980
They're going to report you to Mount Zhaowu.

595
36:04.510 --> 36:05.420
How will you face

596
36:05.840 --> 36:06.650
the immortal sects after this?

597
36:06.840 --> 36:07.780
Let's focus on what's at hand first.

598
36:10.800 --> 36:12.130
My Lord, do it.

599
36:12.670 --> 36:13.300
Do what?

600
36:13.920 --> 36:14.940
I did everything I could

601
36:15.000 --> 36:15.820
to talk Yamao out of it,

602
36:16.110 --> 36:17.380
but she's so stubborn.

603
36:17.800 --> 36:18.740
When it comes

604
36:18.760 --> 36:19.650
to her master,

605
36:19.800 --> 36:21.210
she refuses to see sense.

606
36:21.510 --> 36:22.420
By now, she's probably

607
36:22.510 --> 36:23.210
given Yuwen Hao

608
36:23.280 --> 36:24.010
his spiritual mark back.

609
36:24.510 --> 36:25.300
Take back the wisp

610
36:25.320 --> 36:26.580
of dark energy you gave me to help me

611
36:26.580 --> 36:27.250
take human form.

612
36:27.330 --> 36:29.090
It might restore some of your power and help you

613
36:29.320 --> 36:30.170
fight that lackey.

614
36:30.510 --> 36:31.740
The power I gave you to take human form

615
36:31.760 --> 36:32.660
is insignificant.

616
36:33.150 --> 36:34.490
Taking it back won't help.

617
36:35.280 --> 36:36.340
Then what do we do?

618
36:37.000 --> 36:38.090
What if Yamao really...?

619
36:52.920 --> 36:53.570
Fighting now

620
36:53.590 --> 36:54.610
won't get you anywhere.

621
36:55.150 --> 36:55.970
Settle your scores

622
36:56.150 --> 36:57.610
after we deal with the rabbit demon.

623
37:05.800 --> 37:06.740
Yuwen Hao, you'll handle

624
37:06.920 --> 37:07.780
the mindless husks in the village.

625
37:08.630 --> 37:09.010
Remember,

626
37:09.030 --> 37:10.210
don't let them near Xiangyuan's house.

627
37:10.400 --> 37:11.340
If the rabbit demon appears,

628
37:11.480 --> 37:12.490
capture it first.

629
37:13.840 --> 37:14.210
Youyou,

630
37:14.590 --> 37:15.380
watch Xiangyuan.

631
37:15.550 --> 37:16.210
Don't let her wander off.

632
37:18.630 --> 37:20.650
Given what I said last night,

633
37:21.150 --> 37:22.780
I must have discovered something

634
37:23.070 --> 37:23.860
after I turned mindless.

635
37:24.360 --> 37:25.530
If I can stay lucid

636
37:25.550 --> 37:26.300
during that time,

637
37:26.880 --> 37:27.890
I can tell you

638
37:27.890 --> 37:28.690
everything I see,

639
37:29.110 --> 37:30.210
and we can solve the mystery.

640
37:30.550 --> 37:31.940
How will you stay lucid?

641
37:33.840 --> 37:34.530
Last night,

642
37:34.800 --> 37:36.230
you hit me and snapped me out of it.

643
37:36.960 --> 37:37.690
That means

644
37:38.070 --> 37:39.530
pain can keep me lucid.

645
37:39.550 --> 37:40.570
That's just speculation.

646
37:41.630 --> 37:42.610
The damage from his dark energy

647
37:42.920 --> 37:43.900
has left you weak and drained.

648
37:44.360 --> 37:45.980
Who knows how much pain you'll suffer

649
37:46.510 --> 37:47.690
trying to piece together the truth?

650
37:48.670 --> 37:49.340
Besides,

651
37:50.150 --> 37:51.090
it might not even work.

652
37:55.230 --> 37:55.980
Whether it works or not,

653
37:56.360 --> 37:57.340
I have to give it a try.

654
37:57.440 --> 37:58.170
My master's soul crystal

655
37:58.190 --> 37:59.130
is still with the rabbit demon.

656
37:59.800 --> 38:00.460
Until I get it back,

657
38:00.840 --> 38:02.010
I won't have a moment's peace.

658
38:02.360 --> 38:03.210
What's a little pain?

659
38:04.110 --> 38:05.380
Even if I have to risk my life,

660
38:05.880 --> 38:06.610
I'm willing to do it.

661
38:09.000 --> 38:09.780
You can't take that risk.

662
38:10.800 --> 38:12.210
Leave it to me.

663
38:13.360 --> 38:13.740
No.

664
38:14.190 --> 38:15.050
If we're both out of action,

665
38:15.190 --> 38:16.170
our chances will be even worse.

666
38:17.360 --> 38:18.010
Don't worry.

667
38:18.280 --> 38:18.940
I can take it.

668
38:56.630 --> 38:57.530
It's working.

669
38:58.150 --> 38:59.570
I just saw something.

670
39:02.000 --> 39:03.410
Make sure you snap me out of it again.

671
39:04.710 --> 39:05.760
But you're in so much pain.

672
39:08.320 --> 39:09.090
I didn't know

673
39:09.110 --> 39:10.180
you'd care about that.

674
39:24.150 --> 39:24.940
Cheng Kong

675
39:25.150 --> 39:26.610
has been going away all the time

676
39:26.630 --> 39:27.860
ever since he moved to our village.

677
39:28.070 --> 39:28.860
He's hardly ever home.

678
39:29.360 --> 39:30.780
What's keeping him so busy?

679
